#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit SDK v2.0 or later, with [visualization](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/visualization) support\n"
msgstr "Qiskit SDK v2.0 o mas bago, na may [visualization](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/visualization) support\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit Runtime (`pip install qiskit-ibm-runtime`) v0.22 or later\n"
msgstr "Qiskit Runtime (`pip install qiskit-ibm-runtime`) v0.22 o mas bago\n"

