msgid "Qiskit IBM Transpiler with AI local mode (`pip install 'qiskit-ibm-transpiler[ai-local-mode]'`)\n"
msgstr "Qiskit IBM Transpiler with AI local mode (`pip install 'qiskit-ibm-transpiler[ai-local-mode]'`)\n"

